    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Trace the Roots and Branches of the Multiverse</p></blockquote><p>Barbarians who follow the Path of the World Tree connect through their Rage with Yggdrasil, the cosmic tree that grows among the Outer Planes and links them with each other and the Material Plane. They draw on its magic for vitality and to travel between places.</p><h3>Path of the World Tree Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.cox1ncBKTU6hQfhq]{Vitality of the Tree}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.KeQ6sKpHXsjSVdtd]{Branches of the Tree}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.AYEVXmMzN0E9YwdH]{Battering Roots}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.tZMJCs0r4dGP0XJT]{Travel along the Tree}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
